# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Color-Reliance Diagnostic — repository ignore rules
#
# Tracked: all code, configs, seeds, and the final artifacts (result CSVs,
# logs, tables, figures) needed to reproduce every number and plot in the paper.
#
# Not tracked, and why:
#   - checkpoints/ and runs/ are regenerable. Run the pipeline with the fixed
#     seeds and they reproduce; hosting ~26 GB of weights is unnecessary.
#   - data/ holds the two public datasets, which download automatically.
#   - *.npy are raw per-sample arrays; the summary CSVs built from them are kept.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Regenerable heavy outputs
checkpoints/
runs/
runs_archive/
data/
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt

# Raw intermediate arrays (summary CSVs are kept)
*.npy

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[codz]
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
env/

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
